  "prefLabel": "Env-Sw 1102.02 Co-existence with Other Activities",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 1102.02 Co-existence with Other Activities.\n\n(a) Co-existing activities shall not interfere with construction, operation, and closure of a solid waste facility.\n\n(b) Notification of co-existing activities shall be made in the application for a permit or in accordance with Env-Sw 1105.07.\n\nSource. #5172, eff 7-1-91; ss by #6535, INTERIM, eff 7-1-97, EXPIRES: 10-29-97; ss by #6619-B, eff 10-29-97; (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Sw 1100); ss by #8459, eff 10-28-05 (formerly Env-Wm 2802.02); ss by #10598, eff 7-1-14; ss by #14108, eff 11-13-24, EXPIRES: 11-13-34",
